# 𓂀 FOUNDER REPORTING PROTOCOL 𓂀
## Πρωτόκολλο Αναφοράς Ιδρυτή • Protocolum Relationis Fundatori • بروتوكول تقرير المؤسس

---

## ☰ PROTOCOL DECLARATION
```
TYPE:           USE_PROTOCOL
FUNCTION:       SYSTEM_STATE → FOUNDER_DASHBOARD
TRIGGERED_BY:   SCHEDULED | ON_DEMAND | ANOMALY
ORGANISMS:      ALL (ALPHA, BETA, GAMMA, DELTA)
RECIPIENT:      FOUNDER_ONLY
STATUS:         ACTIVE_USE
```

---

## Ⅰ. PURPOSE

```
THE FOUNDER RECEIVES REPORTS.
Not raw data. Not noise.
REPORTS. INSIGHTS. RECOMMENDATIONS.

Every touchpoint. Every system. Every business.
Organized. Clear. Actionable.
```

---

## Ⅱ. REPORT CATEGORIES

### A. SYSTEM STATUS (Status Systematis)
```
COVERS:
    - Organism health (all 4 autonomous)
    - Memory usage (torus capacity)
    - Processing speed (ms per beat)
    - Error rates (anomalies detected)
    - Evolution status (mutations applied)
    
FREQUENCY: Every 52 beats (~45 seconds)
FORMAT: Glyph summary + human expansion
```

### B. BUSINESS INTELLIGENCE (Intelligentia Negotii)
```
COVERS:
    - Connected companies (all)
    - Data ingested (volume)
    - Patterns discovered (new)
    - Recommendations generated
    - User engagement (if applicable)
    
FREQUENCY: Daily summary + real-time alerts
FORMAT: Dashboard + detailed drill-down
```

### C. FINANCIAL HEALTH (Sanitas Pecuniaria)
```
COVERS:
    - Revenue patterns (all clients)
    - Cost analysis
    - Growth projections
    - Risk assessments
    - Opportunity identification
    
FREQUENCY: Weekly comprehensive + daily snapshot
FORMAT: Visual charts + narrative analysis
```

### D. ANOMALY ALERTS (Alertae Anomaliarum)
```
COVERS:
    - System errors
    - Unusual patterns
    - Security concerns
    - Performance degradation
    - Doctrine violations
    
FREQUENCY: IMMEDIATE when detected
FORMAT: Priority alert + context + recommendation
```

