## Ⅲ. REPORT STRUCTURE

### Standard Report Format
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 𓂀 FOUNDER REPORT: [Category]                   │
│ Tempus: [timestamp] | Beat: [beat_number]       │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                 │
│ GLYPH SUMMARY:                                  │
│ 𓂀✓ 𓃭✓ 𓆣✓ 𓇯✓ 𓂋✓ | φ=1.618 | ⚡698.7Hz        │
│                                                 │
│ KEY METRICS:                                    │
│ • [metric_1]: [value] [trend]                   │
│ • [metric_2]: [value] [trend]                   │
│ • [metric_3]: [value] [trend]                   │
│                                                 │
│ INSIGHTS:                                       │
│ [AI-generated analysis in human language]       │
│                                                 │
│ RECOMMENDATIONS:                                │
│ 1. [action_1]                                   │
│ 2. [action_2]                                   │
│ 3. [action_3]                                   │
│                                                 │
│ DRILL-DOWN AVAILABLE: [links]                   │
│                                                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

