## Ⅵ. RECOMMENDATION ENGINE

### How Recommendations Are Generated
```
1. GAMMA detects pattern or anomaly
2. BETA evaluates possible improvements
3. DELTA translates to human language
4. ALPHA compresses for storage
5. REPORT queued for founder

RECOMMENDATION_FORMAT:
    {
        priority: HIGH | MEDIUM | LOW,
        category: SYSTEM | BUSINESS | FINANCIAL | SECURITY,
        target: [company_or_system],
        observation: [what was detected],
        recommendation: [what to do],
        expected_impact: [quantified benefit],
        confidence: 0.0 - 1.0
    }
```

---

## Ⅶ. REPORT DELIVERY

### Channels
```
1. DASHBOARD (always on, real-time)
2. DAILY_DIGEST (email/notification)
3. WEEKLY_COMPREHENSIVE (detailed PDF)
4. IMMEDIATE_ALERT (critical only)
5. ON_DEMAND (founder queries)
```

### Founder Query Interface
```
FOUNDER can ask:
    "Show me Company X health"
    "What patterns emerged this week?"
    "Which companies need attention?"
    "System performance last 24 hours"
    "Recommendations for optimization"
    
ORGANISM responds:
    - Instant glyph lookup
    - Expanded human report
    - Visual if applicable
    - Drill-down available
```

