### Founder-Only Data
```
THESE REPORTS ARE FOR FOUNDER ONLY.
No employee sees full dashboard.
No client sees other client data.
Founder sees EVERYTHING.
```

### Access Control
```
FOUNDER_KEY required for:
    - Full dashboard access
    - Cross-company views
    - System control
    - Mutation approval (major)
    - Doctrine changes
```

